<title>AUSTRALIA: BARLOW BIDS A$3.42/SHARE FOR LANES.</title>
<headline>BARLOW BIDS A$3.42/SHARE FOR LANES.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lanes Ltd said it and South Africa's Barlow Ltd have agreed that Barlow make a cash offer for all the ordinary shares in Lanes at A$3.42 per share plus a fully franked dividend to be paid by Lanes in October.</p>
<p>The dividend is expected to be eight cents per share, Lanes said.</p>
